{#
  The renter's acknowledgement. It carries the tracking link, which is their
  ONLY way back to their booking — they have no account to log into. That is
  why this email cannot be switched off (§6.28).

  Everything it says comes from a DECLARED variable (module.json): the
  shipped wording and a wording a unit rewrote then have exactly the same
  substitutable surface, and the default text an administrator is offered
  in Configuration > E-mails is this file with its placeholders intact.
#}
{% extends 'email/base.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#212529;">Nous avons bien reçu votre demande</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Bonjour {{ renter_name }},</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
        Nous avons bien reçu votre demande de location pour <strong>{{ asset_name }}</strong>, du
        {{ arrival_date }} au {{ departure_date }}. Nous revenons vers vous dès que possible.
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Votre référence : <strong>{{ reference }}</strong></p>
    {% if hold_note %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{ hold_note }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p style="margin:24px 0;text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{ tracking_url }}"
           style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;background-color:#0d6efd;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">
            Suivre ma demande
        </a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;">
        Conservez ce lien : il est personnel, et c'est votre seul accès au suivi de votre demande.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
